From: Willie Abrams <willie@pobox.com>
Subject: [PATCH] kk: Implement VK_EXT_transform_feedback (mesa!44928)

Squash of https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/44928
at head a4b904d1, cherry-picked onto cc5680bb. Drop once the MR lands upstream.

  10a66fde poly: Compute the room left in an XFB buffer in 64 bits
  54581b68 kk: Keep GS metadata with the pipeline's VS
  bd72a8e5 kk: Support transform feedback in GS emulation
  1f450fa4 kk: Add a passthrough GS for transform feedback
  2386c8ed kk: Rasterize the selected GS stream
  e983a1a3 kk: Support transform feedback stream queries
  d2181140 kk: Implement vkCmdDrawIndirectByteCount2EXT
  a4b904d1 kk: Advertise VK_EXT_transform_feedback
---
